WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:08.150
An enquiry comes in from your website with the customer's own artwork attached.

2
00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:12.910
A quote is one you build yourself, usually with the customer on the phone.

3
00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.750
Start a new quote.

4
00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:19.150
Pick a customer you already have and their details fill themselves in.

5
00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:20.910
Now the lines.

6
00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:25.030
Start typing and your products appear priced from your own supplier list.

7
00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:28.350
One hooded sweatshirt is £16.36.

8
00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:32.870
Set a hundred on the line and the unit price drops to £13.09.

9
00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:36.950
That is your own pricing formula, doing the quantity breaks.

10
00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:41.190
Add another garment, a t-shirt prices on its own formula.

11
00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:46.710
Then add the work: printing, delivery and anything the customer asked for specially.

12
00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:51.250
Write what the customer reads, keep a note for the floor that they never see.

13
00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:56.590
On the right, when the quote went out and how long it stands, choose the layout, let

14
00:00:56.590 --> 00:01:02.030
the customer change quantities or lock them, ask them to sign as they accept.

15
00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:06.630
Set how they pay, a deposit, the whole amount or your own terms.

16
00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:08.550
Save it and send it.

17
00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:12.110
It lands in their inbox in your branding, not ours.

18
00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:15.990
The customer can take lines off and the total follows.

19
00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:20.310
They fill in delivery, then pay online or accept.

20
00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:23.830
Accepted, the lines they took off are gone from the total.

21
00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:25.310
Send it into an order.

22
00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:28.910
That is order 10 on the pipeline and in the order list.

23
00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:31.610
That is a quote, start to finish.

24
00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:36.430
And if the customer goes quiet, the quote chaser follows up on its own, on WhatsApp,

25
00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:40.030
email or text after however many days you set.

26
00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:41.350
No quote goes cold.

